<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan forex market closed for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan forex market closed for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's foreign exchange market was closed on Thursday for the National Day holiday. It will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the Taiwan dollar ended at T$27.493 to the U.S. unit, versus Tuesday's T$27.495 finish. Daily turnover was US$197.5 million.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
